Host: example.com
Content-Type: /html


======
CONTENT-TYPE - subtype vide apres '/' -> 400
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
Content-Type: text/


======
CONTENT-TYPE - point-virgule final sans parametre -> 400
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
Content-Type: text/html;


======
CONTENT-TYPE - parametre sans '=' -> 400
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
Content-Type: text/html; charset


======
CONTENT-TYPE - parametre avec '=' en fin (valeur vide) -> 400
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
Content-Type: text/html; charset=


======
CONTENT-TYPE - parametre avec '=' en debut (nom vide) -> 400
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
