======
CONTENT-TYPE - majuscules autorisees -> OK
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
Content-Type: TEXT/HTML


======
CONTENT-TYPE - duplique avec valeurs differentes -> a verifier (pas de check de doublon actuellement)
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
Content-Type: text/html
Content-Type: application/json


======
COMBO - GET realiste avec plusieurs headers standards -> OK
GET /index.html HTTP/1.0
Host: www.example.com
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0
Accept: text/html
Connection: keep-alive


======
COMBO - POST realiste avec body implicite (Content-Length + Content-Type) -> OK
POST /api/data HTTP/1.0
Host: api.example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 27
Connection: close


======
COMBO - requete avec header inconnu personnalise -> OK
GET / HTTP/1.0
Host: example.com
X-Request-Id: abc-123-def


======
COMBO - premiere erreur rencontree = methode invalide malgre Host invalide plus loin -> 400 (ordre de validation)
FOOBAR / HTTP/1.0
Host: not a valid host

